 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Re-split so that Hud's oath (54:8-55:7, one sentence) stays in one video. Their claims are framed: «رادين لقوله», «بزعمهم», «تأييس منهم», and their slander (54:1-7) only through As-Sa'di's rebuttal. Hud: no motif; the only plate is geometric on «ما من دابة إلا هو آخذ بناصيتها إن ربي على صراط مستقيم». STAGING v4: Hud is a blue drop labelled Hud; 'Ad three faceless men in dark robes in the desert by day. c1 (53): they answer (53:1), the camera on them after his name; they shake their heads on 53:8 (we will not leave our gods) and 53:12 (we do not believe you), framed by the glosses; the idols are never drawn and nobody turns toward an empty side. c2 (54-55): they speak their slander (54:1, framed by As-Sa'di's rebuttal), the camera on them, then wide before Hud answers (54:8); a seal plate for I call Allah to witness (54:10-11); Hud's challenge (54:12-55:7) is held wide with no gesture from anyone else; an hourglass for do not give me respite (55:7). c3 (56): Hud speaks (56:1); geometric for His holding every creature by its forelock and my Lord on a straight path (56:7 to the end); wide holds only. The cover now shows Hud speaking his reliance (56:1)."
 },
